## ⚡ 2. CodeRabbit CLI Review Tool

Run local automated reviews against working diffs or branch comparisons:

```bash
# Review uncommitted working tree diff
python3 config/skills/coderabbit-ai-review/scripts/coderabbit_review.py

# Review staged changes before git commit
python3 config/skills/coderabbit-ai-review/scripts/coderabbit_review.py --staged

# Compare feature branch against main and save report
python3 config/skills/coderabbit-ai-review/scripts/coderabbit_review.py --branch main --save

# Output machine-readable JSON for CI pipelines
python3 config/skills/coderabbit-ai-review/scripts/coderabbit_review.py --json
```

