## 📝 4. GitHub Suggestion Format Standard

Always format actionable code suggestions in standard markdown suggestion blocks so developers can apply them with one click:

````markdown
#### `[MAJOR]` `[Logic/Bug]` `src/network.rs:84`
**Issue:** Socket stream connection is not closed upon early return on error.

```suggestion
let stream = TcpStream::connect(addr)?;
if !stream.is_valid() {
    drop(stream);
    return Err(NetworkError::InvalidSocket);
}
```
````

